- Api and Docs against the real compiled base: every public type and every method found in base.txt; content assist at every .m call site of the base sources offers m with that arity when the receiver is known.
- Round trip properties over random strings of ", `, |, ^, newlines, e acute and astral characters: TaggedText.read(of(s)) and read(line(s)) give s; Info.parse(Info.print(x)) gives x.
- ManagerTest after every test: console.txt equals what the View was shown; state.info and projects.info parse with Info.parse; state.info equals Eclipse.state of the state.
- One table test of the design's refusal list (every verb against unknown name, each kind, busy, a third line), each asserting a note, an Output line, or applied, and projects.info and activity.txt byte identical after a refusal.
- A seeded fuzz of messages in ManagerTest asserting no request is fatal.
- A ProjectTest table over state(), action(), selectedMains() and information(), which are pure.
- A package private rotateNow, so a test checks "the selected project, and in turn one other" without the 3 second timer.
- An injectable clock (InstantSource) for the "after Ns" lines, the report's since and the stored times.
